<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Re sees M&amp;G buy to boost profits.</title>
<headline>Swiss Re sees M&amp;G buy to boost profits.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Reinsurance Co. said its acquisition of Mercantile &amp; General Re from Britain's Prudential Corp for around 3.15 billion Swiss francs to contribute substantially to its earnings and support its goal of a 15 percent return on equity (ROE).</p>
</text>
